bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]roster-shared[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase roster-shared' section: extend the shared numbered member-roster [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]renderer with a document-wide digit allocator, per-entry group labels, a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold-driven entry limit, dismissed-row styling, target roles, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]jump-map merging, leaving every existing roster byte-identical.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]NEIGHBORS section rendering and lane panel wiring[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]neighbors-render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lane-model, roster-shared[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase neighbors-render' section: render the NEIGHBORS section as the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]last metadata-region section of every lane panel, wire the lane fold [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]level through `build_header_text` for single agents, and publish one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]merged member-jump map per lane document.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Digit jump, revive, footer, and help for lane neighbors[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lane-jump[dim] · [dim][/dim]after neighbors-render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase lane-jump' section: extend digit-key member jump to lane [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]containers and neighbor/dismissed target roles, revive dismissed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]neighbors, replace the stale regular-agent fold notification, and update[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the footer and help modal.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fold contracts, visual snapshots, docs, and full check[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish-verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lane-jump[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase polish-verify' section: add lane cases to the cross-kind fold [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract suite, add PNG visual snapshots for the NEIGHBORS section at [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]two fold levels, update docs, and run `just check`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-99","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-99.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-37500daf2d1ed5aacde5041cd96e7248","started_at":"2026-07-25T13:09:12.934845+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1784987171,"sha":"a8f9e5802c395c3cce113edee9dac1c53d56dc08","subject":"feat(tui): extend shared member roster rendering (sase-99.2)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"9a389a9fd7ab54c8e7c9d53655ece562da062b74995043a4291fe399b5ae8755","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-99.2/chat.md","size_bytes":8732},"commits":{"digest":"6c4571b63630f10e9e1cd22966cead34ddede862537cfb1204204962d60e7807","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-99.2/commits.json","size_bytes":238},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-99.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"587ee4c3f18b1e5f75ee9c852c79062c9ab87be21df2f657729cb6dcbec2b6e4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-99.2/meta.json","size_bytes":603},"prompt":{"digest":"d9a66d9e451b8cb80985bf4eb6f171d10c619e6a6022a6fc63e5abc7f7be38fa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-99.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":122},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"d1630826601002c4e4721605d6a369350a3fdeb96997e663fc0fbf0da871c07b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-99.2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":13648},"state":{"digest":"25672ce7fbdc7ef56ce2231d3f96eb991dad55bafc5c9f1f057abc3916215f9a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-99.2/state.json","size_by